      "description": "Students | Moravian University Skip to main content Moravian Home Visit Apply Give Lighting the Way Info For Current Students Alumni Families Faculty & Staff Media Veterans Menu Search About Leadership Facts, Figures & Rankings History & Traditions Community Standards Campus Maps Mission Bethlehem, PA Partnerships News & Events Contact Academics Programs Elevate Experience Academic Support Research Study Abroad Academic Calendar Registrar's Office Reeves Library AMOS Institute for Moravian History & World Heritage School of Theology Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Associates Professional Studies Adult Undergraduate Visit Affordability Cost & Aid Request Information Apply Accepted First-Year Students Life Wellness Dining & Meal Plans Housing Career Success Events Calendar Book Shop Outcomes Internships & Externships Alumni Fellowship Program Moravian Magazine Giving Athletics Quick Actions Moravian Home Visit Apply Give Lighting the Way Info For Information For Current Students Alumni Families Faculty & Staff Media Veterans Moravian College Twitter Moravian College Facebook Moravian College Instagram Moravian University Youtube Moravian College LinkedIn Moravian College Tik Tok © 2026  Moravian University Search Search Keywords Search: Search Menu Career Success Students Career Success Team Career Readiness Badges Job and Internship Search Internships and Externships Career Resources Student Employment Program Financial Literacy Alumni Employers Faculty and Staff About Us FAQs Outcomes Breadcrumb Moravian University Career Success Students Students As a Moravian University student, you have the opportunity to work with the Laurie Riley ’82 Center for Career Success to prepare for your postgraduate endeavors. Whether you plan to go into the workforce, enlist in military service, take a gap year, or prepare for graduate school, we’ll provide you with professional support. As an undergraduate student you’ll meet with a member of your career success team and work together to research career options, discuss internships, begin a job search, build a career toolkit (résumé and cover letter), and so much more! Graduate students can also utilize our services to better prepare for their next career journey. Schedule Your Appointment Student Resources Career Success Team Career Readiness Digital Badges Job and Internship Search Internships and Externships Career Resources Student Employment Program Financial Literacy: Confident Money Management Available Services Interview Room Iris Air Photo Booth Request a Career Success Workshop/Presentation Moravian is proud to partner with Indeed to offer our students the Job Search Academy—a free virtual career development program designed to help you excel in your job search! Access all of Indeed’s resources in one place and explore on-demand content and live programs to strengthen your job search strategy, polish your resume, and stand out in interviews. View JSA Workshops Click here for the full cost of attendance . Moravian College Twitter Moravian College Facebook Moravian College Instagram Moravian University Youtube Moravian College LinkedIn Moravian College Tik Tok 1200 Main Street Bethlehem, PA 18018 1 800.441.3191 610.861.1320 FAX: 610.625.7930 Make a Gift Information for Current Students Alumni Families Faculty & Staff Media Veterans Quick links Academic Calendar AMOS Book Shop Canvas School of Theology Reeves Library Contact Financial Aid Human Resources IT Directory Privacy Policy Disability Accommodation Appeal Non-Discrimination Title IX Community Standards Moravian University is committed to making its website accessible to all users. Should you find content that is inaccessible, please contact webaccessibility@moravian.edu or visit the Office of Disability and Accommodations ."
